triage: fix_game: In the failing scenario the attack was 61 (6 of Clubs) with Spades as trump, and the defender held 94, 104 and 114, all Spades trumps, so a one-card defence is a legal beat under rule (b). The game instead recorded defence_cards [999], treated the defence as TAKE and gave seat 2 four cards; the other three failures are the same bug: valid defences fail, so hands and penalties come out 2 too high.
