triage: fix_tests: The offer, trump-pick and first-attacker scenarios run with "rounds": 0, so no moves are played (the log shows 'moves played: .'). Round 1, where seat 2 offers and seat 1 picks, never happens, and trump correctly stays -1. The game did the deal correctly, so the failures come from the test setup, not the game file.
