triage: fix_game: The rules make round 1 setup only, with no bout, and bouts run in rounds 2 to 40. The game plays a full bout inside round 1 as well: in R1 seat 1 attacked 9, seat 2 beat it with 10 and seat 1 passed, all in r1. As a result `bout` is one ahead everywhere (R1, R3, R4), and in R4 cards changed hands after only the setup round.
