triage: fix_tests: In the trace seat 2 takes once in each bout: card 10, then card 0. It ends holding [0, 1, 2, 3, 10], and hand_size 5 equals the cards actually held, so the game updated hand sizes correctly. The expected 6 does not follow from the hands the test set up and the moves it played; most likely the test's starting hand_size for seat 2 did not match the cards it gave seat 2, or its count was off.
